                  <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="5" align="center"><b> 
                    US media ignoring the peaceful Nablus uprising</b></font></p>
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr align="left" valign="top"> 
              <td height="2"> 
